Z||000019||Steve Normington||07-17-2001||03:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B>i wonder if its possible to put a pin hole in a tire - so it takes about 3 days to go flat</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I had a tire with a 16 guage nail in it. It would lose about 1 psi per day. Not that I am suggesting that, just providing information. Whatever you do with that information is none of my concern.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
